sox-noise (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added man page
  * Improved package meta data to get ready for submission to Debian
  * Changed the .version file in src/sox_noise to be generated
    automatically in the build/install process.
  * Changed 'pyproject.toml' to use dynamic versioning
  * Created 'VERSION' file
  * Changed the release github action workflow to create the tag after
    successful build, instead of being triggered by the tag creation.
  * debian/changelog entry is now copied directly from CHANGELOG.md

