sox-noise (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Take over maintenance of sox-noise, originally authored by Jonathan Knapp.
  * Migrate build system from setup.py to pyproject.toml (setuptools).
  * Restructure project layout to use src/ directory.
  * Add Debian packaging to build .deb releases.
  * Fix broken version detection; freeze application version string.
  * See CHANGELOG.md for full details.

